Description: native Wallpaper Engine wallpaper daemon for Wayland
 we-layerd runs Wallpaper Engine wallpapers through a native renderer on
 Wayland. It supports layer-shell compositors and GNOME, DMA-BUF and SHM
 presentation, interactive pointer input, video wallpapers, web wallpapers,
 and a companion GUI.
 .
 This local package bundles private CEF and DXC runtimes because Ubuntu does
 not provide the required CEF development layout or DirectX Shader Compiler.
